Subject: [PATCH 2/2] The unchecked sendable noncopyable rule no longer flags
 structs storing an unsafe pointer, OpaquePointer, Unmanaged, AnyObject or
 non-Sendable function, and its message says so
 (swift-compositions/swift-linter-rules#12)

---
